# 🐍 Fluent Python — Notes & Practice

Personal notes and practice notebooks while working through [*Fluent Python*]([https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/fluent-python-2nd/9781492056348/](https://elmoukrie.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/luciano-ramalho-fluent-python_-clear-concise-and-effective-programming-oreilly-media-2022.pdf)) by Luciano Ramalho. This repo tracks my progress as I review Python best practices and idiomatic patterns.

---

## 📖 About the Book

*Fluent Python* covers how to write effective, idiomatic Python by diving deep into the language's core features — data models, sequences, functions as objects, object-oriented idioms, and concurrency.

